// CPMX2077 HID Input: in-game settings (Settings > Mods > HID Input).
// The Mod Settings mod shows them and saves them to
// red4ext/plugins/mod_settings/user.ini, where the HID Input RED4ext
// plugin reads them. Without Mod Settings this file does nothing.
// Generated by cp2077mm-hidmap (menu::script); edit it there.

